--- frontend/src/main/github-issue-artifact.ts:47 ---
👮 **Wachiman** · 🟡🧹 **Consider · cleanup: Parentheses are stripped from the uploaded name silently and without a comment (confidence medium)**

`input.name.replace(/[()]/g, "")` changes the filename GitHub receives, so `plan (1).md` becomes `plan 1.md`. The dialog still shows the original name (`GitHubIssueArtifactDialog.tsx:95`), and nothing explains why the characters are removed. Two different files, `a(1).md` and `a1.md`, end up with the same name. Add a comment giving the reason (presumably GitHub rejects parentheses in artifact names) so a later edit does not drop it. Consider showing the sanitized name in the dialog.

